@startuml PlacementHub_End_To_End
title PlacementHub — End to End
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam RoundCorner 8
skinparam ActivityFontSize 13
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 12
skinparam NoteFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2

|Setup|
start
:Super Admin creates college;
:College / Employer / Student register;
:Email verify;
:Login;

|College gates|
:College verifies students (and CVs if required);
:College reviews employer partnership;

|Employer|
:Employer requests campus partnership;
if (Partnership approved?) then (yes)
else (no)
  stop
endif

|Publish|
:Employer posts Job / Internship\nor Placement Drive;
if (College approves listing / drive?) then (yes)
else (no)
  stop
endif

|Apply|
:Student browses open roles;
:Student applies with CV;

|Hiring|
:Employer shortlists / rejects / selects;
:Interviews (optional);
:Offer sent;

|Close|
:Student accepts or declines;
stop

legend right
  Same campus path for **placement drive**
  and **internship** — college approve
  before students can see / apply.
endlegend

@enduml
